  },
  "lines": {
    "p001": {
      "source_hash": "27e073618546",
      "text": "Chief! Camping up a mountain,"
    },
    "p002": {
      "source_hash": "c81545066678",
      "text": "the water was boiling hard,"
    },
    "p003": {
      "source_hash": "cf14c74108eb",
      "text": "but the noodles stayed hard for ages!"
    },
    "p004": {
      "source_hash": "9745f3bebd53",
      "text": "I blamed the gas:"
    },
    "p005": {
      "source_hash": "67dd4e607d53",
      "text": "too weak!"
    },
    "p006": {
      "source_hash": "3e98bd2973ad",
      "text": "But home microwave popcorn"
    },
    "p007": {
      "source_hash": "8deafb923220",
      "text": "went pop-pop-pop, all at once!"
    },
    "p008": {
      "source_hash": "735854b7ae55",
      "text": "Both are the same troublemaker: water."
    },
    "p009": {
      "source_hash": "0480d1648f77",
      "text": "Think about it: both just heat water."
    },
    "p010": {
      "source_hash": "9c50cf208954",
      "text": "Up high, water boils, noodles stay raw,"
    },
    "p011": {
      "source_hash": "b8ef047a9450",
      "text": "yet water in corn blows the kernel open. Why?"
    },
    "p012": {
      "source_hash": "3507021695e8",
      "text": "Boiling means 100 degrees!"
    },
    "p013": {
      "source_hash": "af4beabcaff8",
      "text": "Guess: your pot on the mountain,"
    },
    "p014": {
      "source_hash": "fcc2756c3c94",
      "text": "was it 100 degrees?"
    },
    "p015": {
      "source_hash": "cd6f1bc15477",
      "text": "And your popcorn bowl:"
    },
    "p016": {
      "source_hash": "1cadb9020d03",
      "text": "aren't a few always left that never pop?"
    },
    "p017": {
      "source_hash": "c9bc6ec074ff",
      "text": "Yeah,"
    },
    "p018": {
      "source_hash": "1aa95cba91bc",
      "text": "are they just lazy?"
    },
    "p019": {
      "source_hash": "2a5a8da6cce3",
      "text": "Water holds the answer."
    },
    "p020": {
      "source_hash": "cc23a5381847",
      "text": "Is it set free, or locked in?"
    },
    "p021": {
      "source_hash": "26c7c73004d7",
      "text": "Your mountain pot looked just like the one at home."
    },
    "p022": {
      "source_hash": "f294bcc404a2",
      "text": "Big bubbles rising, near the sea,"
    },
    "p023": {
      "source_hash": "70ccd4714b47",
      "text": "about 100 degrees."
    },
    "p024": {
      "source_hash": "dc53258cb96f",
      "text": "At home, down low, your boiling water is that."
    },
    "p025": {
      "source_hash": "eeae8f7da232",
      "text": "Heated,"
    },
    "p026": {
      "source_hash": "f9278e208c46",
      "text": "why the big bubbles?"
    },
    "p027": {
      "source_hash": "9f00a2ff5958",
      "text": "Hotter water: more turns to steam."
    },
    "p028": {
      "source_hash": "1bf202e5a2a9",
      "text": "Hot enough, and steam bubbles swell up inside the water."
    },
    "p029": {
      "source_hash": "406bbef17816",
      "text": "Turn it up,"
    },
    "p030": {
      "source_hash": "040d5dfe62dd",
      "text": "doesn't it get hotter?"
    },
    "p031": {
      "source_hash": "9dd1454a5756",
      "text": "No. Boiling, it gets no hotter."
    },
    "p032": {
      "source_hash": "c4164308a527",
      "text": "More fire just makes the bubbles wilder."
    },
    "p033": {
      "source_hash": "52685942ed93",
      "text": "Then the extra heat,"
    },
    "p034": {
      "source_hash": "831f2dd1874d",
      "text": "where does it go?"
    },
    "p035": {
      "source_hash": "b5415d0d727f",
      "text": "Making steam that drifts off."
    },
    "p036": {
      "source_hash": "13d0b9380b06",
      "text": "So boiling water has a heat ceiling."
    },
    "p037": {
      "source_hash": "289b5ec1e0f2",
      "text": "The ceiling:"
    },
    "p038": {
      "source_hash": "57053affef58",
      "text": "same height everywhere?"
    },
    "p039": {
      "source_hash": "897abe53c250",
      "text": "Not always. It depends how much air presses down on the water."
    },
    "p040": {
      "source_hash": "8d5b49d92e80",
      "text": "Air?"
    },
    "p041": {
      "source_hash": "971e2caca830",
      "text": "Air's so light,"
    },
    "p042": {
      "source_hash": "c412ee39f772",
      "text": "it presses on things?"
    },
    "p043": {
      "source_hash": "c2f171adcb10",
      "text": "Yes. Above you there's a tall, thick layer of air,"
    },
    "p044": {
      "source_hash": "a4af5e5a0a00",
      "text": "pressing gently on you, and on that pot."
    },
    "p045": {
      "source_hash": "610354f1f7f4",
      "text": "Like a thick quilt of air."
    },
    "p046": {
      "source_hash": "e281228e76f3",
      "text": "Bubbles must push the quilt aside to get out."
    },
    "p047": {
      "source_hash": "25ebe0099e31",
      "text": "The bubbles have to push?"
    },
    "p048": {
      "source_hash": "f2a38306f1c7",
      "text": "Yes. The water must be hot enough for steam to push."
    },
    "p049": {
      "source_hash": "c58b5966a28a",
      "text": "By the sea, the quilt is thickest; water must get hottest."
    },
    "p050": {
      "source_hash": "0fa426d12efd",
      "text": "And up a mountain?"
    },
    "p051": {
      "source_hash": "2acb495b3bce",
      "text": "Higher up, less air above you,"
    },
    "p052": {
      "source_hash": "cdbc5843363b",
      "text": "so the quilt gets thin and light."
    },
    "p053": {
      "source_hash": "84c8c9633202",
      "text": "Thin quilt, cooler bubbles get through."
    },
    "p054": {
      "source_hash": "29d7f18fa964",
      "text": "So water on a mountain"
    },
    "p055": {
      "source_hash": "0b3894e6cb72",
      "text": "boils at a lower heat?"
    },
    "p056": {
      "source_hash": "b5a371dc00c9",
      "text": "Yes. Up about 3,000 meters,"
    },
    "p057": {
      "source_hash": "d9f8bc1c165f",
      "text": "water boils at about 90 degrees."
    },
    "p058": {
      "source_hash": "e73dcd739d6a",
      "text": "Yushan, Taiwan's top, nears 4,000 meters;"
    },
    "p059": {
      "source_hash": "9192baec5f45",
      "text": "up top, water boils under 90 degrees."
    },
    "p060": {
      "source_hash": "da16dd86cc2a",
      "text": "So up high, noodles, eggs and rice"
    },
    "p061": {
      "source_hash": "3a0769d57273",
      "text": "often take longer than at home."
    },
    "p062": {
      "source_hash": "b2655bbc22b3",
      "text": "Boiling at just 80-something!"
    },
    "p063": {
      "source_hash": "88d2c0d4aea8",
      "text": "But it's still bubbling,"
    },
    "p064": {
      "source_hash": "53021ceed4ba",
      "text": "why are noodles still hard?"
    },
    "p065": {
      "source_hash": "409756de54c6",
      "text": "Heat cooks noodles, not bubbles."
    },
    "p066": {
      "source_hash": "ccd8316b34d6",
      "text": "Cooler water gets heat into noodles slower."
    },
    "p067": {
      "source_hash": "fb7cd5b1069d",
      "text": "So it's not weak gas;"
    },
    "p068": {
      "source_hash": "943db42b2eed",
      "text": "the water just isn't that hot."
    },
    "p069": {
      "source_hash": "f833f27e4e64",
      "text": "Then I'll max the heat!"
    },
    "p070": {
      "source_hash": "e24896bc2415",
      "text": "Ceiling, remember? More fire,"
    },
    "p071": {
      "source_hash": "db9b6c7c6e6a",
      "text": "it stays at that temperature, just boils harder."
    },
    "p072": {
      "source_hash": "e307a2e141af",
      "text": "So I just cook it longer!"
    },
    "p073": {
      "source_hash": "35da92098c8b",
      "text": "Yes. So some wondered: in reverse,"
    },
    "p074": {
      "source_hash": "c79d562a4e7a",
      "text": "clamp the lid tight so steam can't escape?"
    },
    "p075": {
      "source_hash": "c495ca1a718e",
      "text": "Lid tight,"
    },
    "p076": {
      "source_hash": "901153ed3de9",
      "text": "does the water get hotter?"
    },
    "p077": {
      "source_hash": "160df1e23311",
      "text": "Yes. A pot whose lid locks is a pressure cooker."
    },
    "p078": {
      "source_hash": "90ec462e2a7a",
      "text": "Up high, people often cook rice in one."
    },
    "p079": {
      "source_hash": "da0a6c8959f0",
      "text": "But adults use it by the manual,"
    },
    "p080": {
      "source_hash": "a21ba0255949",
      "text": "no trapping steam at home to test it."
    },
    "p081": {
      "source_hash": "d725cbb1ea20",
      "text": "Nature makes a tiny one:"
    },
    "p082": {
      "source_hash": "27442fe58ac4",
      "text": "the kernel left in your bowl."
    },
    "p083": {
      "source_hash": "a1872457708c",
      "text": "A popcorn kernel wears a hard, shiny hull,"
    },
    "p084": {
      "source_hash": "f9485afb34e9",
      "text": "and steam can barely get out."
    },
    "p085": {
      "source_hash": "e6eb0ce0681f",
      "text": "Corn on the cob,"
    },
    "p086": {
      "source_hash": "3855627d571b",
      "text": "can it pop too?"
    },
    "p087": {
      "source_hash": "e69a828f94ca",
      "text": "Popcorn is a special corn."
    },
    "p088": {
      "source_hash": "9c98ac9ea2f3",
      "text": "Its hard hull barely lets water through, unlike most grains."
    },
    "p089": {
      "source_hash": "87dadfd0e030",
      "text": "But it's dry and hard,"
    },
    "p090": {
      "source_hash": "70f7ba3b8c27",
      "text": "where's the water?"
    },
    "p091": {
      "source_hash": "3990b80196db",
      "text": "Yes! Inside the hull is soft starch,"
    },
    "p092": {
      "source_hash": "b87647cc1898",
      "text": "with a tiny drop of water hidden in the middle."
    },
    "p093": {
      "source_hash": "7d013b5b1d88",
      "text": "A good kernel: out of 100 parts,"
    },
    "p094": {
      "source_hash": "f181bd9b4fe1",
      "text": "about 14 are water."
    },
    "p095": {
      "source_hash": "8fd89503ec8b",
      "text": "It looks so dry,"
    },
    "p096": {
      "source_hash": "c571424f486c",
      "text": "but it's hiding water!"
    },
    "p097": {
      "source_hash": "85386c78f369",
      "text": "Heated, the drop wants to be steam,"
    },
    "p098": {
      "source_hash": "ff5122590ed5",
      "text": "but the hull keeps it locked inside."
    },
    "p099": {
      "source_hash": "99b749c73bf3",
      "text": "Trapped steam packs tighter inside."
    },
    "p100": {
      "source_hash": "c5eccf152c6e",
      "text": "The kernel is like a balloon, blown tighter and tighter."
    },
    "p101": {
      "source_hash": "a94306fdfa25",
      "text": "But you said"
    },
    "p102": {
      "source_hash": "45e77f218b8d",
      "text": "water can't heat past the ceiling?"
    },
    "p103": {
      "source_hash": "592424b6cb95",
      "text": "Remember the air quilt?"
    },
    "p104": {
      "source_hash": "f745daf4c431",
      "text": "In the kernel, packed steam presses the water, not a quilt."
    },
    "p105": {
      "source_hash": "b8c41b13694b",
      "text": "More pressure, bubbles stall,"
    },
    "p106": {
      "source_hash": "9356020d5668",
      "text": "so water heats past normal boiling: the ceiling rises."
    },
    "p107": {
      "source_hash": "8afd1b9c6816",
      "text": "Opposite of the mountain!"
    },
    "p108": {
      "source_hash": "d686093461c4",
      "text": "Yes. Researchers measured: most kernels pop at about 180 degrees,"
    },
    "p109": {
      "source_hash": "91a0b1c686f2",
      "text": "when the pressure inside is about 9 to 10 times the air outside."
    },
    "p110": {
      "source_hash": "abb5341e5086",
      "text": "The hull's about to burst!"
    },
    "p111": {
      "source_hash": "375da67ee606",
      "text": "Odd thing: researchers figured that before it bursts,"
    },
    "p112": {
      "source_hash": "05bf553da9f4",
      "text": "most of the water inside is actually still liquid."
    },
    "p113": {
      "source_hash": "2e764b9e4237",
      "text": "Even that hot,"
    },
    "p114": {
      "source_hash": "fef4423a0784",
      "text": "and it's not steam yet?"
    },
    "p115": {
      "source_hash": "872dba315059",
      "text": "Right. The pressure keeps most of it liquid."
    },
    "p116": {
      "source_hash": "27b30e64ca1b",
      "text": "Hull breaks, pressure drops, and it rushes into steam."
    },
    "p117": {
      "source_hash": "bb3e9aa2b845",
      "text": "Meanwhile, the starch goes soft and sticky,"
    },
    "p118": {
      "source_hash": "c6587db471c9",
      "text": "like a batter, ready to go."
    },
    "p119": {
      "source_hash": "3a863c5510c5",
      "text": "If I crank it up,"
    },
    "p120": {
      "source_hash": "d38690666d1d",
      "text": "does it pop faster?"
    },
    "p121": {
      "source_hash": "6a78ca2c071f",
      "text": "Too fast is bad. Steam bursts it early,"
    },
    "p122": {
      "source_hash": "ba21d5a4bd86",
      "text": "before the starch softens, leaving a hard half-pop."
    },
    "p123": {
      "source_hash": "14022848fbce",
      "text": "And the leftovers,"
    },
    "p124": {
      "source_hash": "e0f3b699338b",
      "text": "why won't they pop?"
    },
    "p125": {
      "source_hash": "c42ef055e794",
      "text": "Often, they're too dry."
    },
    "p126": {
      "source_hash": "0e44fa9c37af",
      "text": "Too little water can't push hard enough to crack it."
    },
    "p127": {
      "source_hash": "c57052dfdccf",
      "text": "And the tip that joined the cob"
    },
    "p128": {
      "source_hash": "c86a3dac6d7e",
      "text": "doesn't hold steam well; heat too slowly, and steam sneaks out."
    },
    "p129": {
      "source_hash": "d2fd59be8d77",
      "text": "Leaky,"
    },
    "p130": {
      "source_hash": "a94a0c808aab",
      "text": "then it won't pop!"
    },
    "p131": {
      "source_hash": "7c31f3f73e00",
      "text": "When the hull finally bursts,"
    },
    "p132": {
      "source_hash": "935c23df9851",
      "text": "why does it jump?"
    },
    "p133": {
      "source_hash": "0e125d729cad",
      "text": "Does steam shoot out the crack"
    },
    "p134": {
      "source_hash": "f6881a6bafe3",
      "text": "like a rocket, and launch it?"
    },
    "p135": {
      "source_hash": "72d7be01f699",
      "text": "Lots of people guess that. In 2015, two researchers in France"
    },
    "p136": {
      "source_hash": "36d3c23527aa",
      "text": "wanted to see it clearly."
    },
    "p137": {
      "source_hash": "202f34418b9c",
      "text": "They set kernels on hot iron,"
    },
    "p138": {
      "source_hash": "3180a1bb0209",
      "text": "and watched with a camera shooting nearly 3,000 frames a second."
    },
    "p139": {
      "source_hash": "bbbbaf8255a0",
      "text": "3,000 a second!"
    },
    "p140": {
      "source_hash": "006e4c902857",
      "text": "What'd they see?"
    },
    "p141": {
      "source_hash": "cb1439c831f1",
      "text": "First the hull cracks open, and the soft starch"
    },
    "p142": {
      "source_hash": "dc7c35643a9a",
      "text": "bulges out of the crack all at once."
    },
    "p143": {
      "source_hash": "7b2db362a610",
      "text": "The trapped steam lets go at once,"
    },
    "p144": {
      "source_hash": "f64a6a914af4",
      "text": "blowing the soft starch into a big white puff."
    },
    "p145": {
      "source_hash": "0958debafb41",
      "text": "No wonder a small yellow kernel"
    },
    "p146": {
      "source_hash": "084973eedb00",
      "text": "turns into a big white puff?"
    },
    "p147": {
      "source_hash": "7310c632f279",
      "text": "Yes. Only the hull is yellow;"
    },
    "p148": {
      "source_hash": "d65db721061c",
      "text": "the starch was always white."
    },
    "p149": {
      "source_hash": "c99fc7850000",
      "text": "Off the hot pan, the puff cools,"
    },
    "p150": {
      "source_hash": "388b0cbb261c",
      "text": "and hardens: that's the crunch you bite."
    },
    "p151": {
      "source_hash": "030578056b6e",
      "text": "So when does it jump?"
    },
    "p152": {
      "source_hash": "d4aea451ec3b",
      "text": "Puffed starch presses the pan,"
    },
    "p153": {
      "source_hash": "35c3f7378373",
      "text": "like a short little leg."
    },
    "p154": {
      "source_hash": "b8a84a218b76",
      "text": "Popcorn has legs?"
    },
    "p155": {
      "source_hash": "b917fa32e5a1",
      "text": "The leg squashes, then springs back,"
    },
    "p156": {
      "source_hash": "d999a58cac49",
      "text": "and kicks the kernel off the pan."
    },
    "p157": {
      "source_hash": "17ad2339d6b2",
      "text": "So the starch leg makes it jump,"
    },
    "p158": {
      "source_hash": "b10f86e08d63",
      "text": "not steam shooting like a rocket."
    },
    "p159": {
      "source_hash": "4134eb43ee6e",
      "text": "Like me:"
    },
    "p160": {
      "source_hash": "7dfa9891ea45",
      "text": "crouch, then jump!"
    },
    "p161": {
      "source_hash": "c2f314a36f58",
      "text": "Researchers say it jumps a bit like a flea,"
    },
    "p162": {
      "source_hash": "bdb9b2d9af36",
      "text": "and a bit like plants that fling their seeds."
    },
    "p163": {
      "source_hash": "f569eda61dbe",
      "text": "A flea?"
    },
    "p164": {
      "source_hash": "b7af2e1f9756",
      "text": "How fast does it jump?"
    },
    "p165": {
      "source_hash": "b03c15545d15",
      "text": "Crack to jump: a few hundredths of a second,"
    },
    "p166": {
      "source_hash": "c9bb21a79606",
      "text": "your eyes just see a flash."
    },
    "p167": {
      "source_hash": "606d4cf6e48d",
      "text": "Blink and you miss it!"
    },
    "p168": {
      "source_hash": "7a11070fe55e",
      "text": "From the kick alone,"
    },
    "p169": {
      "source_hash": "845ce3a56d8d",
      "text": "they figured about 1 centimeter."
    },
    "p170": {
      "source_hash": "8a391dfe4a61",
      "text": "Only 1 cm?"
    },
    "p171": {
      "source_hash": "c0eccbaa8715",
      "text": "I thought it would fly way up!"
    },
    "p172": {
      "source_hash": "558f7e92e74c",
      "text": "The jumps the researchers saw"
    },
    "p173": {
      "source_hash": "4f20a0f75000",
      "text": "were about the same size as that estimate."
    },
    "p174": {
      "source_hash": "20d3d543dd05",
      "text": "And the pop,"
    },
    "p175": {
      "source_hash": "bcee8c5c404c",
      "text": "is that the hull breaking?"
    },
    "p176": {
      "source_hash": "c5410ab6b5e8",
      "text": "They wondered too, and set up a mic,"
    },
    "p177": {
      "source_hash": "9686d26f8875",
      "text": "recording while they filmed."
    },
    "p178": {
      "source_hash": "74797e9c436b",
      "text": "Matching sound and picture tells each sound's step."
    },
    "p179": {
      "source_hash": "c6264cb70463",
      "text": "That pop,"
    },
    "p180": {
      "source_hash": "b5987e0e8173",
      "text": "how long is it?"
    },
    "p181": {
      "source_hash": "5e55c89d789e",
      "text": "They recorded about a twentieth of a second."
    },
    "p182": {
      "source_hash": "1bc75461d6bd",
      "text": "It must be"
    },
    "p183": {
      "source_hash": "95cb258939fa",
      "text": "the moment it cracks!"
    },
    "p184": {
      "source_hash": "6ce77ec4458a",
      "text": "No sound right at the crack;"
    },
    "p185": {
      "source_hash": "49b93f511b28",
      "text": "a few thousandths of a second later."
    },
    "p186": {
      "source_hash": "8bd370ce42ff",
      "text": "Is it the leg kicking the pan?"
    },
    "p187": {
      "source_hash": "824c5d4dc78b",
      "text": "No. Researchers guess that as the steam rushes out,"
    },
    "p188": {
      "source_hash": "ebe038bf06cc",
      "text": "it makes the little hollows inside ring."
    },
    "p189": {
      "source_hash": "fb0a52a58cb4",
      "text": "Like a blown bottle"
    },
    "p190": {
      "source_hash": "efc254605515",
      "text": "making a hooting sound?"
    },
    "p191": {
      "source_hash": "9cc683cc8702",
      "text": "A bit. Both are air in a hollow"
    },
    "p192": {
      "source_hash": "a3769859682f",
      "text": "pushed suddenly, making a sound."
    },
    "p193": {
      "source_hash": "870c83a2fc55",
      "text": "So crack, pop and jump"
    },
    "p194": {
      "source_hash": "001b3c1cdc9e",
      "text": "are three things, so fast they blur together."
    },
    "p195": {
      "source_hash": "56a6fa65be4d",
      "text": "The pops you hear"
    },
    "p196": {
      "source_hash": "817f8b5a6553",
      "text": "are many kernels, each doing the three steps on its own."
    },
    "p197": {
      "source_hash": "e01f78de3570",
      "text": "So it's three things!"
    },
    "p198": {
      "source_hash": "b277532d793e",
      "text": "Remember the mountain pot? Put it by this kernel:"
    },
    "p199": {
      "source_hash": "95fe3067bb91",
      "text": "an open pot, a sealed kernel."
    },
    "p200": {
      "source_hash": "9824b8a0edd1",
      "text": "Only difference: the push on the water."
    },
    "p201": {
      "source_hash": "a657e3b1be2e",
      "text": "But it's the same rule?"
    },
    "p202": {
      "source_hash": "d8ede68e6d69",
      "text": "Yes, the ceiling rule,"
    },
    "p203": {
      "source_hash": "0fe44f028815",
      "text": "one pressed lightly, one pressed hard."
    },
    "p204": {
      "source_hash": "7415fd0b4453",
      "text": "So,"
    },
    "p205": {
      "source_hash": "353f59014563",
      "text": "air or steam can do the pressing?"
    },
    "p206": {
      "source_hash": "ef09a1e44f58",
      "text": "Yes, either works."
    },
    "p207": {
      "source_hash": "008d1fa2b163",
      "text": "So one rule can leave noodles raw and blow a kernel open."
    },
    "p208": {
      "source_hash": "34e3bbef03ca",
      "text": "To me, the bubbles fool us most:"
    },
    "p209": {
      "source_hash": "97339330e53d",
      "text": "they tell you it's boiling, not how hot it is."
    },
    "p210": {
      "source_hash": "12982bf1859c",
      "text": "Bubbles fooled me!"
    },
    "p211": {
      "source_hash": "d8e549bd59fe",
      "text": "Remember the two things you first asked? You tell me."
    },
    "p212": {
      "source_hash": "f4f1db2c1dc6",
      "text": "The thin quilt!"
    },
    "p213": {
      "source_hash": "7e374e7ea7b6",
      "text": "Water boils under 100,"
    },
    "p214": {
      "source_hash": "b212a4545ed4",
      "text": "so noodles go slow!"
    },
    "p215": {
      "source_hash": "cf02d66fe310",
      "text": "And the corn's hull"
    },
    "p216": {
      "source_hash": "947350c0b378",
      "text": "locks water in, hot enough to burst!"
    },
    "p217": {
      "source_hash": "318266a94482",
      "text": "Next popcorn time, listen first:"
    },
    "p218": {
      "source_hash": "3348a0c6de97",
      "text": "each pop is a kernel finishing those three steps."
    },
    "p219": {
      "source_hash": "9cbbac4a0c7f",
      "text": "A fresh microwave bag is hot;"
    },
    "p220": {
      "source_hash": "a890868a04d5",
      "text": "let a grown-up open it; face away."
    },
    "p221": {
      "source_hash": "36d742bcb996",
      "text": "So that's why!"
    },
    "p222": {
      "source_hash": "1078aa9ddddf",
      "text": "How many unpopped in your bowl?"
    },
    "p223": {
      "source_hash": "fe508e80b52e",
      "text": "Tell us below."
    },
    "p224": {
      "source_hash": "88de677d4daa",
      "text": "Find life's everyday whys with us. Subscribe to So That's Why."
    }
  }
}
